## Project Structure

```
src/
  agents/                     # Agent definitions
    example.ts                # Example agent ({{ agent_framework }})
  tools/                      # Agent tools/functions
{%- if execution_model == "cli" %}
  index.ts                    # CLI entry point (commander)
  commands/                   # CLI subcommands
{%- elif execution_model == "service" %}
  index.ts                    # Bun server entry point
  app.ts                      # Hono app factory
  telemetry.ts                # OpenTelemetry setup
  routers/                    # HTTP endpoint definitions
    health.ts                 # /healthz, /readyz
  controllers/                # Request orchestration
  dtos/                       # Zod request/response schemas
{%- elif execution_model == "web" %}
  app/                        # Next.js App Router
    layout.tsx                # Root layout
    page.tsx                  # Home page
    api/health/route.ts       # Health endpoint
  components/                 # React components
  hooks/                      # Custom React hooks
  lib/                        # Utilities and configuration
{%- endif %}
  config.ts                   # zod-based env/config validation
  logging.ts                  # pino setup
  services/                   # Business logic
{%- if include_clients %}
  clients/                    # External API/service clients
{%- endif %}
{%- if include_database %}
  db.ts                       # Prisma client setup
  repositories/               # Data access layer
{%- endif %}
tests/
  unit/                       # Unit tests
  integration/                # Integration tests
  e2e/                        # End-to-end tests
```

## Key Conventions

- Source code lives in `src/`.
- **Agents** live in `agents/`. Tools the agent can call go in `tools/`.
{%- if execution_model == "cli" %}
- **Commands** are thin I/O wrappers. Parse CLI args, call the agent, format output.
{%- else %}
- **Layering:** routers -> controllers -> services{% if include_database %} -> repositories{% endif %} (agents live in the services layer).
  {% if include_clients %}`clients/` sits beside the data layer and is called from `services/`. {% endif %}`controllers/`, `services/` and `dtos/` ship empty — add the first module
  when you add the first feature.
- **DTOs** are zod schemas for API I/O, always separate from DB models.
{%- endif %}
- Tests are organized by type in `tests/unit/`, `tests/integration/`, `tests/e2e/`.
- Use `external` in test names for tests that hit external services.
- All config is in `package.json` and `tsconfig.json` — no separate config files.

